Task: Remove Accounting main-database environment coupling

Summary:
- Replaced both Accounting root auth-package imports with the company-identity submodule.
- Added an import-surface regression test for the session and company-start routes.
- The test makes any main database package import fail immediately.

Files:
- apps/accounting/app/api/auth/company/start/route.ts
- apps/accounting/app/lib/company-oidc.ts
- apps/accounting/app/lib/__tests__/auth-import-surface.test.ts

Reason:
The root auth barrel evaluates its audit export, which imports the main database package. That package initializes its client and requires DATABASE_URL in production.
